  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hushai atiimia Abusolomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako, Aitiofeli aboolela Abusolomu ali, “Lekha ndobore babaandu chielefu likhumi na chibili mala siilo sino ndaloonda khu Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamwibwaakala naluile lundi nafwiile kumwoyo. Nja khumuriikhirisia, mala babaandu bewe boosi bacha khwilukha. Nja khwiira omwami Daudi yeng'ene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndakhukoboselia babaandu boosi, nga omwea ne acha engo wo museecha wewe. Yiima khukhwira omundu mulala yeng'ene, ne babaandu boosi bacha khuba ne kumuleembe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likaambila lino liasiimisia Abusolomu ne basaakhulu ba Isiraeli boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusolomu aaloma ali, “Nono laanga Hushai omuariki khuulile nilio aloma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Hushai ne eecha khu Abusolomu, Abusolomu aamuboolela niko Aitiofeli amuboolela. Nio areeba Hushai ali, “Khunyala khwaliloonda? Ne khukhanyala tawe, khuboolele nilio khukhola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushai akobosia Abusolomu ali, “Likaambila nilio Aitiofeli amukambiile mu siise sino se lili lilayi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako omanyile oli raraao ne babaandu bewe bali bakhupani be kamaani lundi be lirima nga lie ling'u likhasi nilio banuulile babaana balio. Raraao ali omanyile liie bulayi ne se anyala afukiilila banamae bewe bakona siilo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise sino ekisile mwibina namwe abuundu aandi. Nga Daudi ne alanyoa khukhwibwaakala babaandu bowo, yesi yesi olaulila alaloma ali ‘Babaandu ba Abusolomu beriirwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio akhaba omundu ooli omunyindaafu, yesi yesi ooli ne kumwoyo nga kwe talang'i, acha khuria. Buli mundu mu Isiraeli amanyile ali raraao ali omukhupani owe kamaani lundi banamae bewe bali banyindaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likaambila liase lili liri, ‘Buusia Baisiraeli boosi alala khukhwama khu Dani khukhwola Beerisheba, bakali nga kumuyekhe. Nio wamwene oche mwiie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulanyoola Daudi osi osi niio ali, mala khumwibwaakale nga kamame ne kakwa khwiloba. Mbao omundu akhaba mulala oocha khuona tawe, akhaba Daudi omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaaba bali elukhila mu lukoba, Baisiraeli boosi bacha khureera kimikoye mala bakhwese lukoba luweele mumaayo. Mbao khabaale khacha khuramao tawe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusolomu ne Baisiraeli boosi baloma bali, “Likaambila lia Hushai omuakiti lili lilayi khukhila lia Aitiofeli.” Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aba aabisiisie ali likaambila lilayi lia Aitiofeli lilekhe khufukiililwa tawe, nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areerere Abusolomu butinyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi aboolelwa mala eelukha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Hushai aboolela basaayi Satoki ne Abiatari likaambila nilio aboolela Abusolomu ne basaakhulu Baisiraeli, lundi ne likaambila nilio Aitiofeli abaelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushai atasakho ali, “Nono, rumania khangu burume khu Daudi mumuboolele akhakona siilo sia luno alifubukho niio bambukhilanga luluuchi mu sichiimi tawe. Aambukhe nio niye ne babaandu bewe balekhe khutiilwa ne khukhwirwa tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Yonasani okhwa Abiatari ne Aimaasi okhwa Satoki baba balindiliile a kheechi kha Enirokeli. Omukholi owe siikhasi abayililanga burume ne bacha khuboolela Daudi, sikila se benyekha babonekhane ne bengila mu lukoba tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omusoleeli mulala ababona, mala aboolela Abusolomu. Nga babona bario, belukha khangu bekisa munju eyo mundu okundi mu Baurimu. Omundu oyo aba ne sebele mungo mwewe Yonasani ne Aimaasi bengilamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi wo mundu oyo abukula sifuunikho aasira khu ngaaki khwe sebele mala asalanisiakho bumiicho, mala omundu yesi yesi se amanyakho tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakholi ba Abusolomu nga becha munju, bareeba omukhasi oyo bali, “Aimaasi ne Yonasani bali waena?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi oyo aabakobosia ali, “Bambukhe luluuchi.” Ne nga babaandu abo babayima mala khubanyoola tawe, bakobola Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli bamala khurekukha, Aimaasi ne Yonasani barura mu sebele mala bacha baboolela omwami Daudi bali, “Khola khangu wambukhe luluuchi.” Bamuboolela niko Aitiofeli aba ne alomile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Daudi ne babaandu bewe boosi barakikha khukhwambukha Yoritani. Nga bwasia boosi baba bamalile khukhwambukha luluuchi lwa Yoritani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aitiofeli nga abona ali Baisiraeli se baloondile likaambila liewe tawe, aniina epunda yewe mala aakobola mu lukoba lwewe. Enyuma we khuaana kamalaka kewe kamamaliilisi khu be nju yewe, esuunga mala afwa. Asiikhwa mu ng'ani eya raraawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise nisio Daudi olela mu lukoba lwa Mahanaimu Abusolomu ne Baisiraeli boosi baba bambukhe luluuchi lwa Yoritani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Abusolomu aba ara Amasa khu milimo kie khukhwimeelela banamae mu bweyaangu bwa Yoabu. Amasa aba okhwa Yitira Omuishimaeli, Yitira aba no mukhasi bali Abikali, omukhaana owa Nahasi. Abikali omukooko owa Seruya maawe owa Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusolomu ne Baisiraeli baapa ekambi mu sibala sia Kileati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
